<title>USA: First Home Bancorp Inc Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>First Home Bancorp Inc Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>PENNSVILLE, N.J. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.48		    $0.43</p>
<p>Net interest income</p>
<p>				3,828		    3,732</p>
<p>Provision for credit losses</p>
<p>				  100			100</p>
<p>Gain/loss from loans held for sale</p>
<p>		 gain	     3     loss	    23</p>
<p>Gain/loss from investment securities held for trading</p>
<p>		 gain	    54     gain	    36</p>
<p> Net			  1,298		    1,165</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The bank said net income was impacted by a reduction in the SAIF premium which declined to $42,000 for the first quarter of 1997 from $134,000 in the comparable quarter in 1998.</p>
